features.spec:
Parse OC_comments as a JSON list of strings; if missing or malformed return null; empty list returns 0. Return 1 if any comment matches regex for markdown emphasis: \*\*[^*
]+\*\*|__[^_
]+__|(?<![\*\w])\*[^*\s][^*
]*\*(?!\*)|(?<![_\w])_[^_\s][^_
]*_(?![_\w]). Else 0. Purely mechanical on raw text; no semantic filtering.

